ory\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, on that same middle, August to September came in at 57% of normal and September to October at 45%. Grid 28334 had its driest year in 1976, at 45% of normal.</p>"}
